    "title": "Chester Football Honors Players of the Week - NewsBreak",
    "text": "chssting.com\nwebsite\nChester\nChester Football Honors Players of the Week\nBy Editorials,\n1 days agoThe Chester Football team selected a practice player of the week on Monday, August 18th. Practice players of the week shows teamwork, good work ethic, and help their teammates get better. The coaches all get together at the end of the week to select this player, and this week, Senior Isaac Sims was selected. He plays Offensive Line and Defensive Line. He was asked what he likes most about football, and he replied, “I like hitting people on defense.” This is Isaac’s first year playing football in high school, and he is doing great.",
